OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton's scheme to send free
OL,4,Abooks to children brought back
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the charity has previously
OL,7,Fstruggled in Wales, and there are calls
OL,8,Ffor the programme to be "properly
OL,9,Ffunded" for children across the
OL,10,Fcountry.
